    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "material_designation_info",
      "content": "## EN 1173 - Letter Symbols for Property Designations\n\n- **A**: Elongation\n- **B**: Spring bending limit\n- **G**: Grain size\n- **H**: Hardness (Brinell for castings, Vickers for wrought products)\n- **M**: (as) Manufactured, i.e. without specified mechanical properties\n- **R**: Tensile strength (like R220 - 220 MPa)\n- **Y**: 0.2% proof strength\n\n## Example - Designation\n\nCopper tube EN 1057 R250 12×1.0\n\nWhere R250 is the material temper designation.\n\n## Conversion\n\n1 inch = 25.4 mm"
